  "seats": {
   "bench": 0.45,
   "chair": 0.46,
   "crate": 0.4,
   "step": 0.2
  },
  "rules": {
   "variant": "pick a family's clip for a motion from the person's stable id (FNV-1a), the same on every PC; let a standing idle change now and then (20-50 s) to another of the family's idles, only at the end of a loop, with a 1 s crossfade",
   "talk": "a talker alternates speaking (the talk set) and listening at the end of each loop; a partner within 3 m who also talks takes the other turn; the set comes from the mood if known (angry, cold: cross; warm, amused: eager; else calm), else from the id",
   "sit": "the seat's height picks the variant: under 0.32 m a step, under 0.43 a crate, else a bench or a chair by the id; the hips are lowered by the clip; move the node by seat - seat(clip) * scale and put the feet back on the floor with leg IK near the camera",
   "fallback": "a family without a clip for a motion uses its fallback family's"
  },
